	[m2]see <<plate>>
plate
	[m2]☻ syn. [c brown]Petri dish[/c]
	[m2]Плашка, син. чашка Петри; планшет для микротитрования
Pneumococcal Accelerated Development and Introduction Plan
	[m2][c dimgray](PneumoADIP)[/c]
